From 85de18ae599769b5f310032122af472fadfee805 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SP11 Linux Project <272055834+geocausa@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 06:25:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 10/47] ASoC: lpass-wsa-macro: port SP11 protected render path

Port the validated SP11 WSA macro producer and feedback path from the
Golden-v31 source snapshot onto Linux v7.3. Preserve upstream v7.3 changes
while carrying the Windows-derived VI/CPS and protected-render behavior.

Signed-off-by: SP11 Linux Project <272055834+geocausa@users.noreply.github.com>
